  "details": "I usually limit my avatar size to 50MB.\n\nHowever, when you select \"Show Avatar,\" avatars exceeding 50MB in size will also be displayed.\n\n\"Show Avatar\" is not automatically disabled, and if you are using a high shield level, the capacity limit becomes meaningless.\n\nBecause I stopped using shields to avoid \"Show Avatar,\" I've been a frequent victim of malicious crash attacks.\n\nIdeally, I'd like to use the shielding function and capacity limit simultaneously.\n\n(Translated from Japanese)",
